  "Name": "SAP SOAP RFC SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE Remote Command Execution",
  "Description": "This module abuses the SAP NetWeaver SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE function, on the SAP SOAP RFC Service, to execute remote commands. This module needs SAP credentials with privileges to use the /sap/bc/soap/rfc in order to work. The module has been tested successfully on Windows 2008 64-bit and Linux 64-bit platforms.",
